### Banners & promos

### Create a hero banner (artwork = media asset ids)
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/banners?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "slug": "back-to-work-sale",
  "placement": "HERO",
  "startsAt": "2026-08-15T09:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-09-01T23:59:00Z",
  "target": {"kind": "COLLECTION", "value": "back-to-work"},
  "artwork": {"desktopMediaId": 1, "mobileMediaId": null, "mobileCrop": "center-4-3"},
  "theme": {"textColor": "#ffffff", "overlayOpacity": 40, "alignment": "left"},
  "loggedInOnly": false,
  "translations": [
    {"language": "en", "title": "Back to work sale — 20% off", "subtitle": "Desks, chairs and storage", "ctaLabel": "Shop the sale", "altText": "Office desk with a laptop"}
  ]
}

### Publish (422 CONTENT.BANNER.CAPACITY_EXCEEDED when HERO already has a live banner overlapping)
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/banners/1/publish?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Announcement strip (text only)
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/banners?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"slug": "free-delivery", "placement": "STRIP", "target": {"kind": "URL", "value": "/category/all"}, "translations": [{"language": "en", "title": "Free delivery over $250"}]}

### What wins each placement right now
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/banners/effective?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&placement=HERO
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}
